WEBVTT

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:05.550
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:09.300
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.080
You are my sun now

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:28.500
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.510
no matter who you are

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:36.930
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:45.640
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:51.030
is clear again

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:56.410
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:59.910
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:05.250
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:08.920
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:16.760
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:23.560
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:30.940
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:38.280
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:01.700
<i>After successfully retrieving all seven gems,</i>

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:04.900
<i>Lief and his friends departed to Withick Mire</i>

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:09.000
<i>with representatives from the seven tribes in the hopes of finding the king of Deltora's heir.</i>

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:15.850
<i>On the way there, they were
attacked by Nevets once again,</i>

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:18.560
<i>and Barda was gravely wounded.</i>

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:24.300
<i>Using the power of the gems, they managed to calm Nevets down somehow.</i>

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:27.490
<i>However, after reaching Withick Mire,</i>

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:33.500
<i>what they found there was a land in ruins,
with the appearance of a garbage dump.</i>

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:45.000
This is Withick Mire...?

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:50.000
This garbage pile smells terrible...

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.600
Barda, are you okay?

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:55.700
Yes.

00:02:55.700 --> 00:03:00.600
This smell is nigh unbearable, but my
wounds don't hurt as badly anymore.

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:02.100
That's good to hear at least.

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:06.800
Anyway, we need to hurry and find
a place to rest and treat his wounds.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:07.900
You're right.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:12.110
I'm going to find somewhere to hide the wagon.

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:15.500
The seven tribes are about to finally meet.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:20.400
We have to successfully conduct this ceremony,
before the Shadow Lord finds out.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:24.100
Are you perhaps looking for something?

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:27.400
This is Del city's garbage dump.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:37.700
We have an injured person with us, and we
are looking for somewhere to rest.

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:40.000
Seems like you're in a bit of a bind.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.600
You may come to my house if you wish.

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:47.300
What should we do? He seems a bit
suspicious, doesn't he?

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:50.500
Well, we have to let Barda rest for now.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:51.200
Let's go.

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:58.200
This house looks like it's about to collapse.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.400
Come in.

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:10.800
It's so tidy in here!

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:13.300
This sure is a surprise.

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:15.700
It looks completely different on the outside.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:22.600
Of course I would prepare a proper meeting place for the seven tribes.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:29.100
It would be a real problem if the
Shadow Lord were to find out.

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:31.200
We can't be too careful.

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:34.110
Doom!

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:37.500
Are Dain and the others also here?

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.830
Yes. Zeean, Fardeep and
the rest are here too.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:42.300
I see.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:46.000
I was wondering who it was. So it's you lot, huh?

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.300
Glock!

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.300
I see you're still the same as ever.

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:57.900
I only came here because Doom asked
me to! You should be thanking me.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:01.700
Like hell I'd ever bow my head
in thanks to the likes of you.

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:02.800
Jasmine!

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:05.230
This isn't the time to be fighting!

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:09.400
Glock is the only surviving
member of the Jalis tribe.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:15.200
For the sake of the ceremony,
we need to work together!

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:18.400
What a load of crap.

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:20.900
Is there even any point in such a thing?

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:23.700
Can it really change this rotten world?

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:25.000
Now you listen here...!

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:26.900
We will change it!

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.300
Doom.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:38.400
I want to treat Barda's wounds.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:39.600
Very well.

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:41.000
Jinx!

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:42.100
Yes?

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.400
So, you're finally here?

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.400
I've been waiting for you to come.

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:52.200
Come, you can use the bed.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:55.600
We also need some medicine
that can treat bruises.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:57.100
Herbs would do.

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:59.400
Ah, medicine you say?

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.100
Glock has some of that.

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:04.600
You guys can do something about
that little injury yourselves!

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:08.000
I'm busy dealing with wounded
Resistance fighters.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.500
We don't have enough medicine as it is!

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:12.500
How can you act like this...?!

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:14.900
You're being so cruel!

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:18.590
Glock is right.

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:20.400
Barda!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:25.100
I'm fine.

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:31.000
For now, the meeting of the
seven tribes is more important...

00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:32.200
Barda!

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.500
Let's get him in bed, at the very least!

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:35.700
Okay.

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:49.580
It looks like it hurts pretty bad.

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:53.200
Please, I can handle this much.

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:54.920
Where's Jasmine?

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:58.900
She's collecting water with Zeean and Fardeep.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.430
Zeean is here...?

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:07.200
Zeaan, Fardeep and Doom have also made it here.

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.900
Lief, I'm glad to see that you're well.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.800
Zeean, Fardeep!

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:17.500
We will also do our part to change
the world for the better!

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:20.530
I see...

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:24.300
So, you should just take it easy and rest.

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:25.400
Thank you.

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:35.540
How is Barda's condition?

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:38.300
He's only just now managed to fall asleep.

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:43.600
Is there anything I can do to help out?

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:46.200
Then, help me keep watch of this place.

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:50.500
The Shadow Lord shouldn't
know about this place yet,

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:53.020
but it's better to be safe than sorry.

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:56.800
We have a serious problem!

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:59.800
Grey Guards are approaching from the West!

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:02.300
They will be here any moment!

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:04.600
Jasmine and the others...!

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:06.200
They still haven't returned!

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:08.000
This is really bad!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.950
It will be terrible if they are discovered!

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:18.600
Jasmine!

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:19.880
Lief?

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:22.100
The Grey Guards are coming!

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.600
You need to hide, quickly!

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:24.400
What?!

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:26.640
Where are we supposed to hide?!

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:30.400
There's no time to go back inside!
Hide yourselves in here!

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:35.140
You're almost there...!

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:53.400
Seems like they didn't notice us.

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:55.300
That was dangerously close.

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:02.800
Kree!

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:04.200
You're back!

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.300
Which means...

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:11.800
Lief!

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:14.800
Ailsa!

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:15.980
Gla-Thon!

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:22.100
<i>This is their first meeting in a long time with
Ailsa the Kin and Gla-Thon the Dread Gnome.</i>

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.530
Lief, are you doing well?

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:28.800
You guys really came... Gla-Thon,

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:30.100
Ailsa.

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:33.000
We heard the news from Kree and flew here.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.900
Are we the last to arrive?

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:37.700
No, there's still one more left.

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:38.600
Is that so?

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:41.200
I hope they will be here soon.

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:42.100
Yeah.

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:44.400
Well then, let's hurry and go to the hideout!

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:45.900
Everyone is waiting in there.

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:48.180
It really has been a long time.
Have you been well?

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:53.600
Everyone made it here safely.

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:56.800
Now we just need to wait for Manus.

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:58.600
Yeah.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:09:59.770
Lief?

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:01.600
What's wrong?

00:10:02.900 --> 00:10:06.300
I'm worried. About the Shadow Lord.

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:10.800
Is it about what happened today?

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:15.400
There's also the fact that an Ak-Baba
appeared in the Valley of the Lost.

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:19.900
And now today we've had
Grey Guards appear at Withick Mire.

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:22.350
I can't help but be worried about it.

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:27.050
I've felt that the Shadow Lord
could be watching our movements...

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:32.400
I think I'm going to drink the
water from the Dreaming Spring.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:35.100
I want information about the Shadow Lord.

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:36.430
Lief...

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:42.900
<i>If I drink the water from the Dreaming Spring,</i>

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:46.600
<i>and there's a place I want to see
in my dream, then I can go there.</i>

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:56.700
Relax and go to sleep.

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:58.500
I'll stay here at your side.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:00.000
Jasmine...

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:17.500
How much does the Shadow Lord
know about our movements?

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:21.400
Tell me, water of the Dreaming Spring!

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:41.500
Where is this place?

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:46.400
That's...!

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:48.900
Fallow!

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:51.400
My lord.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:53.470
Fallow.

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:56.720
This is... the Shadow Lord?

00:11:57.100 --> 00:12:01.270
My lord, why do you let Jarred be?

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:05.600
His son is posing a threat to our kingdom!

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:07.500
Fallow!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.800
You understand nothing!

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:16.700
His son, Lief, has already
gathered all seven gems,

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:19.500
and is now searching for Endon's child.

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:22.000
My word!

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.400
Why?!

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:25.760
Why does he know?!

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.600
If that is so, then we must dispatch a
force to pursue them at once!

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:31.880
Perish those foolish thoughts!

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:37.000
You will act only as I direct you to do so.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:39.100
Yes, my lord.

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:41.300
Someone is here...?!

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:45.440
What? There is nobody else in this room.

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:48.100
No, I can sense it.

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:51.150
There is another presence here!

00:12:52.600 --> 00:12:53.700
Lief!

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:55.740
Jasmine...

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:58.500
Are you alright?

00:12:58.500 --> 00:12:59.400
Yeah.

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:04.600
You were here all this time?

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:07.250
That's right. I promised, didn't I?

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:09.600
So, how did it go?

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:11.400
Did you figure anything out?

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:12.800
Actually...

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:17.300
Manus!

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:18.500
Lief!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.400
You made it!

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.450
Yeah!

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:24.400
I'm sorry for being late.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:27.200
I actually rode here on horseback.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.400
On horseback?

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:33.000
A certain store owner let us use
his fastest horse to get here.

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.000
Nanion!

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:35.500
It's been so long!

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:38.000
I'm glad to see you again!

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.300
Me too.

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:42.780
By 'store owner', do you mean Tom?

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:47.100
<i>That</i> Tom has become our ally?

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:49.150
I wonder.

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:52.400
But, it is true that he helped us.

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:56.300
Either way, with this, all of the
seven tribes have gathered.

00:13:56.900 --> 00:14:00.150
Thank you both so much!

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:01.300
Not at all.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:05.600
Our being here is thanks to you.

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:09.100
Thank you.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:14.700
<i>And so, Lief and the others listened
to a report from Manus,</i>

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:19.200
<i>learning that the Grey Guards
were marching westward.</i>

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:26.100
It would seem that the Shadow Lord
is becoming more active.

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:27.700
Regarding that,

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:34.000
I actually drank the water from the
Dreaming Spring and saw the Shadow Lord.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:45.800
So, you're certain that the Shadow Lord knows
you've succeeded in collecting all of the gems?

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:48.200
I'm certain of what I saw.

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.730
Which means, therefore,

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:55.700
there is a spy of the Shadow Lord in our midst.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:58.700
That is the only sensible explanation for this.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.490
That can't be...

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:05.800
Oh dear, now we can't trust anyone anymore!

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:10.400
Glock!

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:14.900
You're late. Where have you been?

00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:17.400
I have no reason to tell a pest like you.

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:21.500
Could it be that you're the...!

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:23.450
Stop it, Jasmine!

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:24.470
L-Lief...

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:26.300
He's right.

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:29.300
This isn't the time to be fighting.

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:30.200
Right.

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:33.000
We finally have everyone
from the seven tribes here.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:37.300
Should we start the ceremony of the
Belt first thing tomorrow morning?

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:40.240
That's a good idea. The sooner the better.

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:44.400
I'll need your help too, Glock,
as the last member of the Jalis tribe.

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:49.800
Lief.

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:50.800
Yeah?

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:55.500
Um, I'm guessing you didn't get
to see your mother and father?

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:56.500
No.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:58.300
But I'm sure they're fine.

00:15:58.300 --> 00:15:59.600
Yeah, you're right.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:03.300
Sorry. I know that your parents are...

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:04.400
It's alright.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:08.680
I was lonely in the past, but now I have friends.

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:13.750
I hope we can find the heir quickly.

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:14.690
Yeah.

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:17.800
I'm sure that the heir is close by.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.690
That's how it feels, anyway.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:25.300
<i>Maybe Jasmine is thinking of Dain?</i>

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:31.800
How is it over there?

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:34.460
Yeah, there's a bit more to tidy up.

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:38.500
Once we are finished with the preparations, the ceremony will begin.

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:39.200
Yeah!

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:40.800
What do you think you're doing?!

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:43.700
I told you to move!

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:45.000
Are you deaf?

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:47.400
I'm preparing for the ceremony!

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:49.050
You're the one who should move!

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:49.930
Jasmine...

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:54.000
It's a shame that I didn't get to
fight you in the tournament.

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:57.200
It would have been nice to
beat some sense into you.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:59.800
Do you honestly think I would
lose to a kid like you?

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:01.800
I really do wonder about that.

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:04.050
Would you like to give it a try, then?

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:05.150
Stop it.

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:06.700
Barda...!

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:10.200
Don't start picking fights,
not at a time like this.

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:15.800
Barda... are you sure you're
alright to be walking around?

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.600
I can't stay asleep like this.

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:23.450
You'll die if you push yourself too hard.

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:26.300
That's because you wouldn't
give him any medicine!

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:28.700
Enough about me.

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:31.180
Let's hurry and begin the oath ceremony.

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:32.850
Yeah.

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.500
Glock.

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:37.450
You must take part in this ceremony,

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:40.100
regardless of how you may feel about it.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:55.370
This time we, the Carn Unit,
shall return with the Belt in hand.

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:11.900
It's finally time.

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:13.550
Yes.

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:16.500
Now then,

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:20.810
to all representatives of the
tribes, please move forward.

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:30.900
W-What?!

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:35.200
This can't be!

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.200
Enemy attack! Enemy attack!

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:42.410
That's...

00:18:42.410 --> 00:18:43.920
the Carn Unit!

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:49.700
Why have they come here?!

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:53.000
As I suspected, information
may have been leaked!

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:54.400
Take them down swiftly!

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:55.300
Right!

00:19:00.300 --> 00:19:01.310
Lief...

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:03.700
Maintain your formation.

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:05.700
Move as planned.

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:11.200
At this rate...!

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.100
Everyone, move in close together!

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:17.800
The Carn Unit is trying to divide us
and take us down individually!

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:18.700
What?!

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:23.100
Everyone needs to stay
close and fight together!

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:36.200
Line up like this and face the enemy as one!

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:39.430
Lief, look!

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:43.500
Glock! Get over here!

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:01.200
How pathetic.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:03.500
Weren't you supposed to be strong?

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:07.600
Glock. Let's combine our strength and fight!

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:14.500
Don't lose your focus!

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:16.500
Huh,

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:17.470
not bad.

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:25.900
Okay! Let's push forward together!

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:27.100
Right!

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:30.600
Now we will show them the
strength of all seven tribes united!

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:33.000
What the hell are you all doing?!

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:49.460
So it's you again.

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:54.600
Lief!

00:20:58.600 --> 00:21:01.400
<i>We've finally gotten this far!</i>

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:13.650
Lief!

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:15.030
Lief!

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:17.300
We won't lose!

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:31.600
You did it, Lief!

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:39.680
It's all thanks to you guys
fighting together as one.

00:21:44.600 --> 00:21:47.100
That was close back there, wasn't it?

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:50.500
And for you as well.

00:21:52.300 --> 00:21:54.700
But, you did save me there.

00:21:57.500 --> 00:21:58.800
Wait a moment!

00:22:00.600 --> 00:22:02.600
You saved me as well!

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:04.100
Hey!

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:05.700
What's your problem?!

00:22:05.700 --> 00:22:07.600
I had started to think a little better of you...!

00:22:09.600 --> 00:22:11.900
Don't you need medicine, first of all?

00:22:11.900 --> 00:22:14.300
To heal Barda's wounds.

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:17.600
Glock...

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:24.000
It seems that the seven tribes
are united at long last.

00:22:26.200 --> 00:22:27.100
Yeah.

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:53.390
I would be lying to you

00:22:53.550 --> 00:22:59.180
if I said I wasn't lonely

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:05.690
I know I'm not being honest

00:23:06.270 --> 00:23:11.530
but I just can't put it into words

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:18.500
It's for the sake of our dreams

00:23:20.120 --> 00:23:22.040
At this point

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:27.750
to sing "I love you" to a faraway you

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:34.050
my voice would simply fade into the wind

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:40.350
In a way, that's worse than saying "goodbye"

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:47.440
But someday our dreams will bloom

00:23:47.770 --> 00:23:55.820
Dreams X Dreams

00:24:06.200 --> 00:24:08.600
The Seven Gems - the Ruby.

00:24:09.200 --> 00:24:12.950
<i>The gem of the Ralad tribe,
found in the Lake of Tears.</i>

00:24:12.950 --> 00:24:14.600
<i>It brings good fortune.</i>

00:24:14.780 --> 00:24:19.840
<i>When evil beings or monsters draw near,
its colour will fade to tell its owner to be wary.</i>

00:24:20.500 --> 00:24:25.000
The seven gems of the Belt have been assembled, and the seven tribes have gathered.

00:24:25.000 --> 00:24:27.600
All that's left is the king's heir.

00:24:28.000 --> 00:24:30.430
I've got it! He's the heir!

00:24:30.900 --> 00:24:34.820
Lief and the Oath Ceremony

00:24:31.350 --> 00:24:34.820
Next time, 'Lief and the Oath Ceremony'.

00:24:49.790 --> 00:24:54.800
See you next time
